12 Creatures/Sci-fi Smart Materials Pack For Substance Painter ideal for concept art/design to boost your speed at Substance Painter and increase the detail of your sci-fi creatures, a quite good addition to your low-poly and high-poly workflow paint at Substance Painter
12 Creatures/Sci-fi Smart Materials Pack For Substance Painter works on Substance Painter (2020) and up. 
Contents:
/// 12 Creatures/Sci-fi Smart Materials Pack For Substance Painter
/// Jpeg samples of the product.

Modeled in 3ds max 2020, rendered with V-Ray and Corona Render. Photorealistic 3D model, that will help you to add realism to your project. Hope you like it!
File Formats:
.max 2017 and 2020.obj (Multi Format).mtl.mat.dae
Features:

  - Model is included Scanline, Vray and Corona materials

  - Model consists of 204,087 Polys and 219,572 Vertices;

  - Units used: mm

  - Lights and cameras are not included in the scenes;

  - All textures and materials are tailored and applied for high-quality render results;

Please contact me through the support for any inquiries.

The model has 2 materials.
2048x2048 textures packs (PBR Metal Rough, Unity HDRP, Unity Standard Metallic and UE4):
PBR Metal Rough: BaseColor, AO, Height, Normal, Roughness and Metallic;
Unity HDRP: BaseColor, MaskMap, Normal;
Unity Standard Metallic: AlbedoTransparency, MetallicSmoothness, Normal;
Unreal Engine 4: BaseColor, Normal, OcclusionRoughnessMetallic;
The package also has the .fbx, .obj, .stl, .dae and .blend file.

