Two Blender files:

  - one containing just the model itself;

  - the other containing the scene used to render the promotional images you've likely already seen - this file includes all the pepper and environment textures embedded;

Exchangeable model files - fbx, obj, dae, stl, ply.
Textures:

  - all in png format - Albedo, Roughness, Normal Map, SSS Mask, SSS Color, Occlusion;

  - in three resolutions - 1K, 2K, and 4K.

Enjoy your usage :)

